note.p:
Source: Library of Congress, Manuscript Division, Kissinger Papers, Box TS 44,
                    Geopolitical File, Vietnam, Cables, 24 June–29 August 1972. Top Secret;
                    Sensitive; Immediate.

A detailed account of Haig’s meeting with Lon Nol on July 3 is in telegram 4219
                    from Phnom Penh, July 3. (Ibid., Box 513, Country Files, Far East, Cambodia,
                    Vol. 15)
